; DT818_pro_v2.1_h - 6-stream ORB rank portfolio + 6 retry-hedge sub-streams
; Generated 2026-05-13. Use with ea/DT818_pro_v2.1_h.mq5 (v2.1 timezone fixes +
; retry hedge logic + tp_mult support).
;
; PARENT total risk: 9.0% (1.5% × 6 streams), same as v2.1 9pct setfile.
;   S1-S3 = MAY2 R1-R3 (previous-week WFO), magics 1111/2222/3333
;   S4-S6 = MAY9 R1-R3 (current-week WFO),  magics 4444/5555/6666
;
; HEDGE config (from sim_wfo_hedge_retry_global.py WFO 2026-05-13):
;   Global expire_minutes = 720 (12h)
;   Global F1 filter      = DISABLED (max_seconds_after_entry=0)
;   Per-stream tp_mult:   S1=1.0, S2=0.75, S3=0.75, S4=1.0, S5=0.75, S6=0.75
;   Hedge magics: 7111/7222/7333/7444/7555/7666
;
; Backtest result (77d, $10k, 1.5% per stream):
;   no-retry:  NP=+$87,318  DD=8.70%  NP/DD$=10.31
;   +retry:    NP=+$121,714 DD=8.81%  NP/DD$=10.48  (+$34k NP, +0.17 NP/DD$)
;   Note: 0/7 P0 pass — decay filter rejects all; OOS NPs decay W1→W4

